    "details": {
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p><strong>Concept.</strong> A Sarmoung Brotherhood runabout built for arriving without having been seen to leave. Mufflers on the engine, mufflers on the crew, mufflers on the questions you&#39;d otherwise ask.</p>\n<p><strong>Signature.</strong> It is already gone. It was never here. The Phase Cloak does most of the lying; the crew handles the rest.</p>",
